id: SAVE18-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: export_unsent_draft
target: crates/core/src/history_export.rs
find:             HistoryOp::Reload | HistoryOp::Engine(_) => None,
replace:             HistoryOp::Reload | HistoryOp::Engine(_) => Some(false),
expect-fail: trailing_reload_does_not_hide_the_last_draft
note: ops の末尾の規則で Engine・Reload を飛ばさない（現在の Step が無い間の下書きを数えない）
